{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"逆环假设"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"逆环假设"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"范畴论","text":"范畴论"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p><strong>逆环假设</strong> (delooping hypothesis) 是一系列关于高连通性的"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶范畴","text":"高阶范畴"}},{"Plain":"与带 "},{"Local":{"url":"En-代数","text":"$\\mathbb E_n$"}},{"Plain":" 结构的"},{"Local":{"url":"高阶范畴","text":"高阶范畴"}},{"Plain":"之间的对应的命题.</p>\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 一个 $(\\infty,n+k)$-范畴, 小于 $n$ 阶的态射都唯一, 那么它等同于 $\\mathbb E_n$-幺半 $(\\infty,k)$-范畴:\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{Cat}_{(\\infty,n+k)}^{*,\\geq n}\r\n\\ \\begin{aligned}\r\n\\overset{\\Omega^n}{\\longrightarrow}\\\\\r\n\\underset{\\mathrm{B}^n}{\\longleftarrow}\r\n\\end{aligned}\\ \r\n\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathbb E_n}\r\n(\\mathsf{Cat}_{(\\infty,k)}).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong>注</strong>.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>等价的两边是 $(\\infty,1)$-范畴, 即我们不考虑更高阶不可逆态射.</li>\n<li>$\\mathsf{Cat}_{(\\infty,n+k)}^{*,\\geq n}$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"带基点对象","text":"带基点"}},{"Plain":" $(n-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"连通性","text":"连通"}},{"Plain":" $(\\infty,n+k)$-范畴的范畴, 这里的基点很重要.</li>\n<li>$\\Omega := \\operatorname{End}(*)$ 是取基点对象的自同态; 对于带基点 $\\mathbb E_{n}$-幺半 $(\\infty,k)$-范畴 $\\mathcal C$, 有 $\\Omega\\mathcal C$ 为带基点 $\\mathbb E_{n+1}$-幺半 $(\\infty,k-1)$-范畴.</li>\n<li>对于 $\\mathbb E_n$-幺半 $(\\infty,k)$-范畴 $\\mathcal C$, 其 “"},{"Local":{"url":"逆环路空间","text":"逆环"}},{"Plain":"” $\\mathrm{B}\\mathcal C$ 是 $\\mathbb E_{n-1}$-幺半 $(\\infty,k+1)$-范畴; $\\mathrm{B}$ 就是 $\\Omega$ 的逆运算.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>$n=1,k=0$ - 仅有一个对象的范畴等同于幺半群:</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\mathsf{Cat}_{(\\infty,1)}^{*,\\geq 1}\r\n\\ \\begin{aligned}\r\n\\overset{\\Omega}{\\longrightarrow}\\\\\r\n\\underset{\\mathrm{B}}{\\longleftarrow}\r\n\\end{aligned}\\ \r\n\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathbb E_1}\r\n(\\mathsf{Ani}).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>$n=1,k=1$ - 仅有一个对象的 "},{"Local":{"url":"2-范畴","text":"$2$-范畴"}},{"Plain":"等同于"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半范畴","text":"幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":":</p>\n<p>$$\r\n\\mathsf{Cat}_{(\\infty,2)}^{*,\\geq 1}\r\n\\ \\begin{aligned}\r\n\\overset{\\Omega}{\\longrightarrow}\\\\\r\n\\underset{\\mathrm{B}}{\\longleftarrow}\r\n\\end{aligned}\\ \r\n\\mathsf{Alg}_{\\mathbb E_1}\r\n(\\mathsf{Cat}).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}